# Project 1: Online Retail Sales KPI Tree

## 1. Sales Revenue & Growth (Business Performance)
├── Total Sales Revenue (£)
├── Monthly Revenue Growth (%)
├── Month-on-Month Revenue Change (%)
├── Total Number of Orders
└── Average Order Value (AOV)
    ├── Revenue per Order (£)
    └── Average Items per Order

## 2. Product Performance (Sales Contribution)
├── Total Quantity Sold
├── Top 10 Products by Revenue
├── Top 10 Products by Quantity
├── Product Revenue Contribution (%)
└── Best-Selling Product Categories
    ├── Product-Wise Revenue (£)
    └── Product-Wise Quantity Sold

## 3. Customer Performance (Customer Value & Loyalty)
├── Total Unique Customers
├── Repeat Customer Rate (%)
├── Revenue per Customer (£)
├── Top 10 Customers by Revenue
└── Customer Purchase Behaviour
    ├── Number of Repeat Customers
    └── Average Orders per Customer

## 4. Market Performance (Geographical Sales Analysis)
├── Total Countries Served
├── Revenue by Country (£)
├── Orders by Country
├── Top 10 Countries by Revenue
└── Country Contribution to Total Revenue (%)

